WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A source clip becomes inspectable, timestamped evidence.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Use an original six-second clip. Preserve its identity and metadata.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
These frames come from the actual clip, with decoded presentation timestamps.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Connect the source, frame time, observation and interpretation.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Sparse frames are partial evidence. Audio needs its own inspection.

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Timestamped evidence. Clear coverage limits. By Lex from SigmaStudioz.

